# Programme builder

Drafts are editable. Published sessions are what the athlete logged against. Do not rewrite published targets when a benchmark or formula input changes.

Copy Week copies prescription into an empty week and strips athlete feedback. It must not replace a published week or a week that already has athlete history unless the existing explicit replace rules say so.

Auto-Carry only moves forward one week into an empty, unpublished target. It does not jump ahead or move backward.

Blocks continue past 4. Week 16 to 17 is Block 5. Do not hard-code a maximum of 4.

Run `npm run qa:hyrox-programme` after a change in this area.
